high-volume poster, so my absence would in fact be noted...this is not
a brag.)

I wish all of you well, in this life, in future uploaded
instantiations, and even in whatever religious afterlifes you may find
yourself actually in (but I'll still take cell repair, cryonics, and
uploading in a Santa Cruz minute over prayers and burnt offerings).

Good luck, Omward, Outward, Upload, etc. It's been a real E ticket
ride this last year.

